<description>&lt;p&gt;Rival armed groups in Burkina Faso are now fighting each other, with JNIM and ISSP intensifying clashes in the north, while Ukrainian officers are training Sahel militants on drone use. In northern Nigeria, violence has forced tens of thousands of civilians to flee into Niger, and opposition leader Atiku has accused President Tinubu of failing Nigerians after 638 people were killed and 64,000 fled. The conflict continues to drive large civilian displacement and intra-group fighting across the Sahel. 4,159 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiW0FVX3lxTE9nbXFMQ3VGb1NoQmhSRlh0dUdpU1ZGVm44MVRxZFNGODFuVmp1RjRGR2hLYzZnUWpUWWpoV0RieWpCZ0lYVXJwR1ZMTlgtOThMdmVTcUhveElmcEk?oc=5&quot;&gt;BBC&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqwFBVV95cUxOb2xYNnBaTFZmOEc1UFZvR0tnV2RHUnJ2WGNCZ3VqU2VBMzNOaEktZjhUcF9XNlNaNDIydk9ZbU5zQnJhSGdhQ05ib1dHME50Qm9HeGhTWHJHYXpacm45QlZMaE5XVmF1LUJld3NIWnJwOEhKclNrOENTQTN0TDBXLWFrSzQ0RXM1cVhiWnprQ1hzNHVCLWhxN05OaG5vRW14ODhYVTZ4MDlVOWM?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimAFBVV95cUxQMmllSmZYUmtHSWhxX2hwbG5kZl9rRWN5NzRuLWhHYjA5OGJkNm1oZmR2MTdkUURwNEp4Rlo3MFJlYnR4QmtWRG1RS0hvM09xWTdWUkN3OVpCenFhUkRQZTA1MGFlTWVLVjNrNXFjaVBJVlA2clpfWV9GNjVWU0VrbVdfdE5WWTFqOVRCOUlIRUtyN05NbWY0NQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Sport News Africa&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMioAFBVV95cUxQalNMX1NHajh6cjJoWmY2d0FHc09mYzZhQ19RbXJsMlJzbHIyRVVHcTdvYndCeFg4OUpjNVBtQVA4UTVuYTgySW91Z1VIVmRhWi0tNW0ydkdIZ09ObjdBOGFBcl9PNUwwYjhYVy1ZX2RFbWFrUW1aeDl6ZWdRR3hIWVJ2S0JlTVUwVGdKbi1jbnYtSUJfUDI1bzBNY0YzZkRq?oc=5&quot;&gt;UA.NEWS&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/article